    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Group and Aggregate Ocean Heat Data\r\n\r\nThe program calculates the mean `Ocean Heat Content` for the entire dataset.\r\n\r\nUse AI Tutor to build and explain code that answers:\r\n\r\n**How did average Ocean Heat Content change from the 1990s to the 2010s?**\r\n\r\n1. Run the program and examine the overall mean.\r\n2. Group the data by `Decade` and calculate the mean `Ocean Heat Content` for each group.\r\n3. Print the grouped means.\r\n4. Calculate and print the change from the 1990s to the 2010s.\r\n\r\nHow is the grouped mean more useful for answering the data question than the overall mean?",
    "ai_tutor_available": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
